{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1551156-scion-demigod-companion","id":1551156,"title":"Scion Demigod Companion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-20T06:38:35-07:00","id":1551156,"title":"Scion Demigod Companion","content":"Hello to all. I have heard rumors that the Scion Demigod Companion backer PDF is out. Can anyone confirm it to me, and if so, tell me what is in there? I am particularly interested in whether there are any new pantheons in there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12934-manbat","name":"Manbat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12934_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-20T23:42:37-07:00","id":1551175,"title":"","content":"Confirmed. <br /> <div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">What's in This Book</span></b><br /> <b>Chapter One: Wonders and Worlds</b> provides Dominion Boons for <b>Demigod's</b> Pantheon Specific Purviews, new Boons, and a walkthrough of new strange places and Terra Incognitae for your characters to explore. <br /> <br /> <b>Chapter Two: Allies and Companions</b> introduces optional rules for leveling up Creatures alongside their Demigod companions, provides Storyguiding advice for portraying Guides, and includes new Follower organizations and expanded rules for Cults and Covenants. <br /> <br /> <b>Chapter Three: Items of Power</b> delves into expanded relic crafting rules. It also introduced relic forges and organizations and optional rules for crafting relics from materials gathered from Titanspawn. Lastly, it includes new relics from across the pantheons. <br /> <br /> <b>Chapter Four: Titans and Titanspawn</b> takes a deeper look at the Titans and Titanspawn introduced in Demigod, exploring their backgrounds, goals, and rivalries. Additionally, it offers ideas for Storyguides and players for games involving only one or two people and alternative methods of storytelling at your table using troupe play. <br /> </div><br /> No new Pantheons; and I would have been surprised to find any.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-20T23:46:49-07:00","id":1551177,"title":"","content":"It's out to campaign backers, but not up for general sale yet; they're doing errata.<br /> <br /> No new pantheons; it's got additional content for the pantheons in Demigod - signature Purviews, Boons, Terra Incognitae, Titans, etc. - plus a chapter on allies and companions and a chapter on Relics and Relic crafting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-21T00:50:36-07:00","id":1551179,"title":"","content":"Expanded Relic rules *again*? We already had that in Mysteries of the World. I'd rather have expanded Creature Birthright creation rules, cause the vanilla one is barebones, confusingly written and provides no clear examples.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","name":"ChronoRebel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-30T06:27:15-07:00","id":1551340,"title":"","content":"I just got the book, and I am missing something, or do they give some rules for PSP Dominion for the pantheons in the Demigod book but not for the first 10 pantheons? Where are the rules for the pantheons in hero, like Metamorphosis Dominion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12934-manbat","name":"Manbat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12934_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-02T09:43:19-07:00","id":1551426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manbat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1551156-scion-demigod-companion?p=1551340#post1551340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just got the book, and I am missing something, or do they give some rules for PSP Dominion for the pantheons in the Demigod book but not for the first 10 pantheons? Where are the rules for the pantheons in hero, like Metamorphosis Dominion?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Kickstarter was very clear that the Companion would only cover the Pantheons in Demigod. What we have in the Companion can then be used as a baseline to figure out what could be possible for other PSPs. That said, you aren't the first person to be confused by that, its probably been the most frequently asked question about this book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">